# Portfolio Git workflow

Follow the Git workflow in AGENTS.md for every task in this repository.
Work on a feature, fix, chore or experiment branch, never directly on main.
Preserve existing edits and create recoverable commits for useful checkpoints.
On completion, validate, push the task branch and open or update its pull request,
unless the user explicitly asks to keep the work local.
Do not merge, publish, force-push, rewrite published history or delete checkpoint
branches/tags without explicit user authorization for that action.
